[{"id":"25857","date":"2026-10-24T08:21:24+00:00","text":"🚨 THE FIA ​​WANTS TO REDUCE THE WEIGHT OF 2030/2031 CARS BY 80 KILOS The cars will be about 2.5 - 3 seconds faster just by weight, says Nikolas Tombazis - Some of the weight reduction will come from the change of power unit, even though a main V8 block will be slightly bigger than a V6. In terms of battery, which contributes a lot to the current car weight, the smaller electrical element planned will result in this being cut back - There's also a plan to reduce the dimensions of the car to make it smaller, and wheel rim size could be reduced. It is estimated that the extra weight of tyres triggered by the jump from 13-inch wheels to 18 inches in 2022 contributed about 25kg to the weight increase 📰 The Race","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/HdNuuEr2BhN8oQ3mC7tbNtHWU-79EFl69eMXRiDUgt_44hIjmzG-Gx0h2bEYVNu9Q8K_8kQD08taEDKXURcMTXDjlotcm9nofVVDmsoSCJc3fQEwSVidI7j3BMv5dUwpQxPeATuo85KcEnPG1TZSyXQcCUMQsuiMgtFbZKAxkkA8YiJ4pxCBHBE8QD-pplXlV97BAVsNedgSKRvhmj0ORyg47eBsKzz1e4uB9A0R0hynZiCclsHpRWFHBmoIXC5l9KBB3mPn07Jn-_w2XEYCcKFbzRSTu_YOGj9123eFHMtjCO_3So5rUb5vaXBMdREFh5Sar4BOVrghwZtbT1HdXw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"25856","date":"2026-10-24T06:38:01+00:00","text":"There's a selection of special livery designs to keep an eye out for this weekend at COTA 😍 🎨 👀 #F1 #USGP 🇺🇸","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/DATjrkoX4uWfEzhpVGOcuJWOuu9nkSiPriSMxe2PgssGLwS0xoLl1Gt1luYhfKlZ629RPXHoyyoN4FmWCxWqwnZKmwcILBSxVaSwdrbsrPizGQlgE7JgcuTU1mPQlkDsknq30vRNukoru4KmwaU7-zSrhCv2zjPp5cUdEz78bT3wz8HIJbZqoBr3VNJbFNuUIpPSPaDNO5bz7eNgX1gSigwi7chxSJU89Se-SPqh-U1cyWByR_Kec1ygSxFse4AmheGrugIXDVytj7IAapOvQcMghH-U40nzOIMVAi5Kt4Ftrs47uqhKVhizvGZ2CpgRJ6hfVLBonhPz1TTqvUzy6Q","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"25855","date":"2026-10-24T06:19:02+00:00","text":"There are people and media outlets in the paddock who, if races are held in Qatar and Abu Dhabi, will decide NOT TO ATTEND either race 📰 x/TSlafer","image":"https://cdn4.teles